{"id":"galcw7idcd8uslj4ouifdfis5","title":"激光驱动的磁态违背平衡规则","originalTitle":"Laser-driven magnetic state defies equilibrium rules","summary":"美国能源部橡树岭国家实验室的研究团队利用激光和中子散射技术，在磁性材料中观察到一个持久的量子态，打破了物质平衡规则。该研究在非平衡状态下展示了激光如何推动材料出其常态，中子散射揭示了这一状态的细节，并表明这种状态在低能量下可以持续存在，而非短暂消失。这一发现为研究其他非平衡量子态提供了平台，有助于指导量子材料和低损耗电子技术的发展。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-laser-driven-magnetic-state-defies.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T17:00:10.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T17:07:17.626Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T17:07:17.626Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":38,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"05f0e524-8133-45b0-ae01-1da02cfae2f7","title":"激光驱动磁性材料中非平衡量子态持久存在"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"05f0e524-8133-45b0-ae01-1da02cfae2f7","title":"激光驱动磁性材料中非平衡量子态持久存在"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fJdYuZKZfDqc","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}